{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8be8ab5c-db0e-11ef-a781-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8be8ab3d-db0e-11ef-9082-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宇文","people_name_jianti_auto":"宇文","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"afb2887b-db0e-11ef-9460-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"afb2887c-db0e-11ef-8899-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"成周","place_name_jianti_auto":"成周","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"afb2887d-db0e-11ef-a98d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宇文相魏，倣成周之制建官。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宇文相魏，倣成周之制建官。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"afb2887a-db0e-11ef-83c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"afb2887f-db0e-11ef-b179-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此蓋秦所築長城也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此盖秦所筑长城也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"afb2887e-db0e-11ef-b640-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"五原","place_name_jianti_auto":"五原","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"afb28881-db0e-11ef-8e0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"府设蒲坂【山西永济】","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"afb28882-db0e-11ef-b933-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"afb28883-db0e-11ef-9e2c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"afb28884-db0e-11ef-903d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦州","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦州","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"afb28885-db0e-11ef-9ee9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"afb28886-db0e-11ef-afba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"afb28887-db0e-11ef-bc52-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲坂","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲坂","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"afb28888-db0e-11ef-b7db-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自五原還至蒲州也。五代志：河東郡，後魏置秦州，後周改曰蒲州，因蒲坂爲名也。趣，七喻翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自五原还至蒲州也。五代志：河东郡，后魏置秦州，后周改曰蒲州，因蒲坂为名也。趣，七喻翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"afb28880-db0e-11ef-b88c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"府设蒲坂【山西永济】","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"afb28898-db0e-11ef-bda9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、平凉府（卷五十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"盖繇高平而北至秦所筑长城也。自隋以后，为原州治。唐广德后...","context_before":"...。寻复为胡琛、万俟丑奴等所据。永安三年，尔朱天光击平之。","source_end_index":434,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"335d8a7f-98e9-5f65-8fbc-ec1408a4298a","source_start_index":404,"source_text":"西魏大统十四年，宇文泰奉太子钦巡西境，登陇至原州，历北长城。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/七、平凉府（卷五十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后周，县废。隋开皇十九年，使长孙晟筑大利城，以处突厥启民...","context_before":"...五原，军败。明年，元深击拔陵，被围于五原，深乘间还朔州。","source_end_index":222,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ffe7ad59-dbd0-562d-8ea1-fc595a3ffc3e","source_start_index":189,"source_text":"西魏大统五年，宇文泰奉太子钦巡抚境内，自北长城东趣五原，还至蒲州。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"14五月，魏以丞相泰爲太師，廣陵王欣爲太傅，李弼爲大宗伯，趙貴爲大司寇，于謹爲大司空。太師泰奉太子巡撫西境，登隴，至原州，歷北長城，東趣五原，至蒲州，聞魏主不豫而還。及至，已愈，泰還華州。","content_fanyi":"五月，西魏任命丞相宇文泰为太师、广陵王元欣为太傅、李弼为大宗伯、赵贵为大司寇、于谨为大司空。太师宇文泰侍奉太子巡视西部边境，登上陇山，到达原州，经过北长城，向东前往五原，到达蒲州，听说西魏主生病，便返回。回到都城时，西魏主已经痊愈，宇文泰又返回华州。","content_jianti_auto":"14五月，魏以丞相泰为太师，广陵王欣为太傅，李弼为大宗伯，赵贵为大司寇，于谨为大司空。太师泰奉太子巡抚西境，登陇，至原州，历北长城，东趣五原，至蒲州，闻魏主不豫而还。及至，已愈，泰还华州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":15132,"number":14,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六十一 (梁紀十七) / 高祖武皇帝十七 / 太清二年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"afb28879-db0e-11ef-9442-a0d3651f611f","year_int":548},"tongjian_id":"afb28879-db0e-11ef-9442-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"后齐","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae7b-db0e-11ef-bf23-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"太子中庶子，職如侍中，後齊門下坊之長也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"太子中庶子，职如侍中，后齐门下坊之长也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae7a-db0e-11ef-b5e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊孝昭","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐孝昭","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae7e-db0e-11ef-b316-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","place_note":"首都邺城【河北省临漳县西南邺镇】","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae7f-db0e-11ef-9ae4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae80-db0e-11ef-a356-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以當時東西二國觀之，齊若富強，而其根本實撥；周若貧弱，而其根本實牢。若齊孝昭欲用其強富，周固有以待之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以当时东西二国观之，齐若富强，而其根本实拨；周若贫弱，而其根本实牢。若齐孝昭欲用其强富，周固有以待之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae7d-db0e-11ef-9177-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae82-db0e-11ef-aa14-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍州","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae83-db0e-11ef-84ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae84-db0e-11ef-b0c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦州","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦州","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae85-db0e-11ef-b8b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae86-db0e-11ef-80cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"东魏","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae87-db0e-11ef-8a2d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦州","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦州","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae88-db0e-11ef-aff0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae89-db0e-11ef-832a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沙苑","place_name_jianti_auto":"沙苑","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae8a-db0e-11ef-b834-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","place_note":"山西省西南部","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae8b-db0e-11ef-894b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西魏","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae8c-db0e-11ef-8d16-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae8d-db0e-11ef-bee1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲阪","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲阪","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae8e-db0e-11ef-a813-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae8f-db0e-11ef-a4cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏神䴥元年，置雍州於河東，延和元年，改曰秦州，太和中罷。魏旣分爲東、西，東魏天平初，復置秦州於河東；沙苑敗後，河東之地入于西魏，後周因蒲阪舊名而置蒲州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏神䴥元年，置雍州于河东，延和元年，改曰秦州，太和中罢。魏既分为东、西，东魏天平初，复置秦州于河东；沙苑败后，河东之地入于西魏，后周因蒲阪旧名而置蒲州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae81-db0e-11ef-97b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"「損」，當作「資」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"「损」，当作「资」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae90-db0e-11ef-98d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"一年一更戍也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"一年一更戍也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":181,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae91-db0e-11ef-8e8d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"府设蒲坂【山西省永济县】","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"b1f74af6-db0e-11ef-b2b7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其后周主邕伐齐，乃曰：前出河外[先是周主伐齐，出河阳，攻...","context_before":"...于五胡迭兴，索头继起，平阳居必争之会，未有免于锋镝者也。","source_end_index":365,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"7adafbb7-a267-5334-9c53-1e4f442bba8e","source_start_index":276,"source_text":"及周、齐相争，平阳如射的。然齐卢叔虎尝谓其主演曰：今宜立重镇于平阳，与彼蒲州相对，深沟高垒，运粮积甲，彼闭关不出，则稍蚕食其河东地，使日穷蹙。彼若出兵，非十万以上，不足为我敌也。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"齊主徵前開府長史盧叔虎爲中庶子。叔虎，柔之從叔也。帝問時務於叔虎。叔虎請伐周，曰：「我強彼弱，我富彼貧，其勢相懸。然干戈不息，未能幷吞者，此失於不用強富也。輕兵野戰，勝負難必，是胡騎之法，非萬全之術也。宜立重鎭於平陽，與彼蒲州相對，深溝高壘，運糧積甲。彼閉關不出，則稍蠶食其河東之地，日使窮蹙。若彼出兵，非十萬以上，不足爲我敵。所損糧食咸出關中。我軍士年別一代，穀食豐饒。彼來求戰，我則不應；彼若退去，我乘其弊。自長安以西，民疏城遠，敵兵來往，實自艱難，與我相持，農業且廢，不過三年，彼自破矣。」帝深善之。","content_fanyi":"北齐孝昭帝征召前开府长史卢叔虎出任中庶子。卢叔虎是卢柔的堂叔。孝昭帝向卢叔虎询问时政。卢叔虎请求讨伐北周，说：“我方强盛而对方衰弱，我方富裕而对方贫穷，双方形势相差悬殊。然而战事至今不停，却仍不能吞并北周，错就错在没有利用我方的强大和富庶。派轻兵在旷野作战，胜负难以保证，这是胡人骑兵的战法，不是万全之策。应当在平阳设立重镇，与对方的蒲州相对，深挖壕沟，高筑壁垒，运送粮草，积蓄兵甲。对方如果闭关不出，我们就逐步蚕食他们河东的土地，使他们的处境日益窘迫。如果对方出兵，没有十万以上的兵力，就不足以做我们的对手。对方大军所消耗的粮食都要由关中供给。我们的士兵每年轮换一次，军粮丰足。对方前来求战，我们就不应战；对方如果撤退，我们就乘其疲惫出击。从长安以西，百姓稀少，城池相距遥远，敌军往来，确实十分艰难，与我军长期相持，农业生产将会荒废，不过三年，他们就会自行败亡。”孝昭帝非常赞同他的分析。","content_jianti_auto":"齐主征前开府长史卢叔虎为中庶子。叔虎，柔之从叔也。帝问时务于叔虎。叔虎请伐周，曰：「我强彼弱，我富彼贫，其势相悬。然干戈不息，未能幷吞者，此失于不用强富也。轻兵野战，胜负难必，是胡骑之法，非万全之术也。宜立重镇于平阳，与彼蒲州相对，深沟高垒，运粮积甲。彼闭关不出，则稍蚕食其河东之地，日使穷蹙。若彼出兵，非十万以上，不足为我敌。所损粮食咸出关中。我军士年别一代，谷食丰饶。彼来求战，我则不应；彼若退去，我乘其弊。自长安以西，民疏城远，敌兵来往，实自艰难，与我相持，农业且废，不过三年，彼自破矣。」帝深善之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":15931,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六十八 (陳紀二) / 世祖文皇帝上 / 天嘉元年 / 第 69 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae79-db0e-11ef-8c7e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":560},"tongjian_id":"b1f6ae79-db0e-11ef-8c7e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"二渠皆以灌漑。","note_content_jianti_auto":"二渠皆以灌漑。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b2013b1c-db0e-11ef-881e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"府设蒲坂【山西省永济县】","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b2013b1f-db0e-11ef-9529-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《志》云：州城北有溥惠渠，又有永济渠，筑堰障之，谓之土龙...","context_before":"...。秦穆公五年，与晋战于河曲。吕相绝秦，所谓入我河曲者也。","source_end_index":105,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a09874e9-e62f-5815-bf33-8d65064c288b","source_start_index":80,"source_text":"宇文周保定初，凿河渠于蒲州，盖导河入渠，以资灌溉。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"","context_before":"...因立祠焉。是也]。作之十余岁，渠颇通，犹未得饶，后遂废。","source_end_index":849,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"99719864-4326-5621-bf72-0ba180539b6c","source_start_index":827,"source_text":"后周保定二年，亦于同州开龙首渠，以广灌溉云。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3壬寅，周人鑿河渠於蒲州，龍首渠於同州。","content_fanyi":"壬寅日，北周在蒲州开挖河渠，在同州开凿龙首渠。","content_jianti_auto":"3壬寅，周人凿河渠于蒲州，龙首渠于同州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":15977,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六十八 (陳紀二) / 世祖文皇帝上 / 三年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b2013b1b-db0e-11ef-b0f9-a0d3651f611f","year_int":562},"tongjian_id":"b2013b1b-db0e-11ef-b0f9-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b289940e-db0e-11ef-833f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"同州","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","place_note":"府设武乡【陕西省大荔县】","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b289940f-db0e-11ef-ad6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"同州","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b2899410-db0e-11ef-bbad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b2899411-db0e-11ef-845f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自蒲州西南至同州一百三十里，同州西南至長安二百二十五里。傳，張戀翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自蒲州西南至同州一百三十里，同州西南至长安二百二十五里。传，张恋翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b289940d-db0e-11ef-9d3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"叱羅","people_name_jianti_auto":"叱罗","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b2899414-db0e-11ef-8754-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏收","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏收","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b2899415-db0e-11ef-b3ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"叱羅氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"叱罗氏","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b2899416-db0e-11ef-b6ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"協","people_name_jianti_auto":"协","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b2899417-db0e-11ef-ae52-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"拓跋","place_name_jianti_auto":"拓跋","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b2899418-db0e-11ef-9266-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"同州","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b2899419-db0e-11ef-ad2c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"叱羅，虜複姓。魏收官氏志：拓跋內入諸姓有叱羅氏。協時在同州。璽，斯氏翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"叱罗，虏复姓。魏收官氏志：拓跋内入诸姓有叱罗氏。协时在同州。玺，斯氏翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"b2899413-db0e-11ef-9706-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b289941f-db0e-11ef-b05e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"護世子訓爲蒲州刺中，是夜，帝遣柱國越公盛乘傳徵訓，至同州，賜死。昌城公深使突厥未還，遣開府儀同三司宇文德齎璽書就殺之。護長史代郡叱羅協、司錄弘農馮遷及所親任者，皆除名。","content_fanyi":"宇文护的世子宇文训正担任蒲州刺史，当天夜里，武帝派柱国越公宇文盛乘驿车征召宇文训，到同州后，赐他自杀。昌城公宇文深出使突厥还没有返回，武帝派开府仪同三司宇文德带着玺书前去就地将他处死。宇文护的长史代郡人叱罗协、司录弘农人冯迁以及他所亲近信任的人，都被削除名籍。","content_jianti_auto":"护世子训为蒲州刺中，是夜，帝遣柱国越公盛乘传征训，至同州，赐死。昌城公深使突厥未还，遣开府仪同三司宇文德赍玺书就杀之。护长史代郡叱罗协、司录弘农冯迁及所亲任者，皆除名。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16393,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十一 (陳紀五) / 高宗宣皇帝上之下 / 太建四年 / 第 17 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b289940c-db0e-11ef-ba61-a0d3651f611f","year_int":572},"tongjian_id":"b289940c-db0e-11ef-ba61-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"府设蒲坂【山西省永济县】","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b2b61a2e-db0e-11ef-9a31-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"25甲寅，周主如蒲州；丙辰，如同州；十一月，甲戌，還長安。","content_fanyi":"二十五日甲寅，北周国主前往蒲州；丙辰，又前往同州；十一月甲戌，返回长安。","content_jianti_auto":"25甲寅，周主如蒲州；丙辰，如同州；十一月，甲戌，还长安。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16531,"number":25,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十一 (陳紀五) / 高宗宣皇帝上之下 / 六年 / 第 31 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b2b61a2c-db0e-11ef-80bf-a0d3651f611f","year_int":574},"tongjian_id":"b2b61a2c-db0e-11ef-80bf-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b306d155-db0e-11ef-b16a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b306d156-db0e-11ef-88dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦州","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦州","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b306d157-db0e-11ef-8462-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b306d158-db0e-11ef-8013-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b306d159-db0e-11ef-a65d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲坂","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲坂","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b306d15a-db0e-11ef-8976-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：河東郡，後魏曰秦州；後周改蒲州，因蒲坂以名州也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：河东郡，后魏曰秦州；后周改蒲州，因蒲坂以名州也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b306d154-db0e-11ef-82a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宇文泰","people_name_jianti_auto":"宇文泰","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b306d15d-db0e-11ef-9f58-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宇文","people_name_jianti_auto":"宇文","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"b306d15e-db0e-11ef-b886-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"同州","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","place_note":"府设武乡【陕西省大荔县】","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b306d15f-db0e-11ef-9d9a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b306d160-db0e-11ef-ac39-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b306d161-db0e-11ef-8f2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"同州","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b306d162-db0e-11ef-9f7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b306d163-db0e-11ef-b7e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"同州","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b306d164-db0e-11ef-a205-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長春宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"长春宫","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"b306d165-db0e-11ef-9d19-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朝邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"朝邑","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b306d166-db0e-11ef-9785-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"b306d167-db0e-11ef-9889-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"同州治馮翊。宇文泰輔魏，多居同州，其後受魏禪，遂以同州置別宮。長春宮在朝邑，馮翊之屬縣也。是宮蓋亦宇文所置。","note_content_jianti_auto":"同州治冯翊。宇文泰辅魏，多居同州，其后受魏禅，遂以同州置别宫。长春宫在朝邑，冯翊之属县也。是宫盖亦宇文所置。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b306d15c-db0e-11ef-9755-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"府设蒲坂【山西省永济市】","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b306d169-db0e-11ef-9210-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6三月，戊辰，周於蒲州置宮，廢同州及長春二宮。","content_fanyi":"三月初一戊辰日，北周在蒲州建造行宫，将同州和长春两处行宫一并废除。","content_jianti_auto":"6三月，戊辰，周于蒲州置宫，废同州及长春二宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16704,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十三 (陳紀七) / 高宗宣皇帝中之下 / 十年 / 第 8 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b306d153-db0e-11ef-bcc1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":578},"tongjian_id":"b306d153-db0e-11ef-bcc1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"蒲坂•山西省永济市","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a2-db0e-11ef-becf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲坂","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲坂","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a3-db0e-11ef-9be9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a4-db0e-11ef-89da-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a5-db0e-11ef-b075-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蒲州，蒲坂，河津之要，去長安三百餘里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"蒲州，蒲坂，河津之要，去长安三百余里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a1-db0e-11ef-a132-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉州","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋州","place_note":"临汾•山西省临汾市","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a7-db0e-11ef-8f57-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a8-db0e-11ef-92fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a9-db0e-11ef-bcf3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b3a093aa-db0e-11ef-a579-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉州，平陽，用武之地。周、齊兵爭，以爲重鎭。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋州，平阳，用武之地。周、齐兵争，以为重镇。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a6-db0e-11ef-b505-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朝，直遙翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朝，直遥翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"b3a093ab-db0e-11ef-bc89-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"於殿庭面質其事。","note_content_jianti_auto":"于殿庭面质其事。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"b3a093ad-db0e-11ef-8b03-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"蒲坂•山西省永济市","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b3a093b0-db0e-11ef-a7a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"忻欲使士彥於蒲州起兵，己爲內應，士彥之甥裴通預其謀而告之。帝隱其事，以士彥爲晉州刺史，欲觀其意；士彥忻然，謂昉等曰：「天也！」又請儀同三司薛摩兒爲長史，帝亦許之。後與公卿朝謁，帝令左右執士彥、忻、昉於行間，詰之，初猶不伏；捕薛摩兒適至，命之庭對，摩兒具論始末，士彥失色，顧謂摩兒曰：「汝殺我！」丙子，士彥、忻、昉皆伏誅，叔姪、兄弟免死除名。","content_fanyi":"宇文忻想让梁士彦在蒲州起兵，自己则在长安做内应。梁士彦的外甥裴通参与了密谋，却告发了他们。隋文帝隐忍未发，任命梁士彦为晋州刺史，想借此观察他的心意；梁士彦大为欣喜，对刘昉等人说：“这是上天在保佑我们啊！”他又请求让仪同三司薛摩儿出任晋州长史，隋文帝也同意了。不久后，梁士彦等人与公卿大臣一同入朝谒见，隋文帝命左右侍卫在朝列中拘捕梁士彦、宇文忻、刘昉三人，责问他们谋反之事，他们起初还不认罪；这时薛摩儿恰好被捕获押到，隋文帝命他到殿堂上与梁士彦等人当面对质，薛摩儿把谋反的始末一一说出，梁士彦大惊失色，回头对薛摩儿说：“你杀了我！”闰八月二十八日丙子，梁士彦、宇文忻、刘昉都被处死，他们的叔侄、兄弟免除死罪，被削职为民。","content_jianti_auto":"忻欲使士彦于蒲州起兵，己为内应，士彦之甥裴通预其谋而告之。帝隐其事，以士彦为晋州刺史，欲观其意；士彦忻然，谓昉等曰：「天也！」又请仪同三司薛摩儿为长史，帝亦许之。后与公卿朝谒，帝令左右执士彦、忻、昉于行间，诘之，初犹不伏；捕薛摩儿适至，命之庭对，摩儿具论始末，士彦失色，顾谓摩儿曰：「汝杀我！」丙子，士彦、忻、昉皆伏诛，叔姪、兄弟免死除名。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17079,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十六 (陳紀十) / 長城公下 / 四年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b3a093a0-db0e-11ef-b891-a0d3651f611f","year_int":586},"tongjian_id":"b3a093a0-db0e-11ef-b891-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"蒲坂•山西省永济市","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b3a6aecd-db0e-11ef-a93f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"13冬，十月，隋主如同州；癸亥，如蒲州。","content_fanyi":"冬季十月，隋文帝前往同州；癸亥日，又前往蒲州。","content_jianti_auto":"13冬，十月，隋主如同州；癸亥，如蒲州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17107,"number":13,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十六 (陳紀十) / 長城公下 / 禎明元年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b3a6aeca-db0e-11ef-98bb-a0d3651f611f","year_int":587},"tongjian_id":"b3a6aeca-db0e-11ef-98bb-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":5,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"丘","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4548b46-db0e-11ef-8f7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"左丘明","people_name_jianti_auto":"左丘明","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b4548b47-db0e-11ef-8eef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太公","people_name_jianti_auto":"太公","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b4548b48-db0e-11ef-b839-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"獻帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"献帝","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b4548b49-db0e-11ef-8dbc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘敦氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘敦氏","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4a-db0e-11ef-8501-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘氏","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4b-db0e-11ef-9343-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘和","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘和","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4c-db0e-11ef-bd56-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘敦氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘敦氏","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4d-db0e-11ef-be78-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4e-db0e-11ef-b7e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"營丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"营丘","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4f-db0e-11ef-bcbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b4548b50-db0e-11ef-86d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"拓跋","place_name_jianti_auto":"拓跋","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"b4548b51-db0e-11ef-b596-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"b4548b52-db0e-11ef-837e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"b4548b53-db0e-11ef-856a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"b4548b54-db0e-11ef-a78c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"b4548b55-db0e-11ef-8391-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋制，左右武衞將軍，領外軍宿衞。風俗通：丘姓，左丘明之後。又云：太公封於營丘，支孫以地爲氏。又魏書·官氏志：後魏獻帝次弟丘敦氏，後改爲丘氏。按拓跋南都洛陽，凡北人從之南遷者，三字姓、複姓皆改從單字姓，爲河南洛陽人。丘和旣洛陽人，蓋卽丘敦氏之後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋制，左右武衞将军，领外军宿衞。风俗通：丘姓，左丘明之后。又云：太公封于营丘，支孙以地为氏。又魏书·官氏志：后魏献帝次弟丘敦氏，后改为丘氏。按拓跋南都洛阳，凡北人从之南迁者，三字姓、复姓皆改从单字姓，为河南洛阳人。丘和既洛阳人，盖即丘敦氏之后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b4548b45-db0e-11ef-a922-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武后","people_name_jianti_auto":"武后","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b4548b59-db0e-11ef-90bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"中宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"中宗","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5a-db0e-11ef-b33e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5b-db0e-11ef-91c7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"羃，莫狄翻。䍦，音離。新唐志曰：婦人施羃䍦以蔽身。永徽中，始用帷冒，施帬及頸。武后時，帷冒益盛。中宗後，無復羃䍦矣。按帷冒起於隋。騎，奇寄翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"羃，莫狄翻。䍠，音离。新唐志曰：妇人施羃䍠以蔽身。永徽中，始用帷冒，施帬及颈。武后时，帷冒益盛。中宗后，无复羃䍠矣。按帷冒起于隋。骑，奇寄翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b4548b58-db0e-11ef-9c2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"山西省永济市","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5e-db0e-11ef-88eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"門司，蒲州之掌城門者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"门司，蒲州之掌城门者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5d-db0e-11ef-a46d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"榮","people_name_jianti_auto":"荣","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"b4548b60-db0e-11ef-b191-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周榮公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周荣公","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b4548b61-db0e-11ef-95e6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"勃海郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"勃海郡","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b4548b62-db0e-11ef-a03d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"棣州","place_name_jianti_auto":"棣州","place_note":"山东省阳信县","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b4548b63-db0e-11ef-9e41-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"沧州","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b4548b64-db0e-11ef-9314-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北平郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"北平郡","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4548b65-db0e-11ef-813f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平州","place_name_jianti_auto":"平州","place_note":"河北省卢龙县","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b4548b66-db0e-11ef-9793-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"勃海郡，開皇六年置棣州。大業二年改滄州。北平郡，舊置平州。榮姓，周榮公之後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"勃海郡，开皇六年置棣州。大业二年改沧州。北平郡，旧置平州。荣姓，周荣公之后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5f-db0e-11ef-b8a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"諒","people_name_jianti_auto":"谅","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b4548b68-db0e-11ef-98f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲津","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲津","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b4548b69-db0e-11ef-9af0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6a-db0e-11ef-8610-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6b-db0e-11ef-ba62-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此蒲津之橋也，諒欲斷河，謂可坐有舊齊之地耳。斷，音丁管翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此蒲津之桥也，谅欲断河，谓可坐有旧齐之地耳。断，音丁管翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"b4548b67-db0e-11ef-9784-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"臨汾郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"临汾郡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6d-db0e-11ef-9eb8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉州","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋州","place_note":"山西临汾市","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6e-db0e-11ef-94c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛郡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6f-db0e-11ef-9b4b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b4548b70-db0e-11ef-b0d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"东雍州","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b4548b71-db0e-11ef-8c59-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4548b72-db0e-11ef-95b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛州","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b4548b73-db0e-11ef-8cae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党郡","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b4548b74-db0e-11ef-993f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b4548b75-db0e-11ef-a54f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潞州","place_name_jianti_auto":"潞州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b4548b76-db0e-11ef-b6ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党郡","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b4548b77-db0e-11ef-aa15-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄垣縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄垣县","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b4548b78-db0e-11ef-858e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"b4548b79-db0e-11ef-a488-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓州","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩州","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7a-db0e-11ef-957d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長平郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"长平郡","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7b-db0e-11ef-b595-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建州","place_name_jianti_auto":"建州","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7c-db0e-11ef-bc1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"澤州","place_name_jianti_auto":"泽州","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7d-db0e-11ef-a7bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋志：臨汾郡，晉州。絳郡，後魏置東雍州，後周改絳州。上黨郡，後周置潞州。上黨郡襄垣縣，後周置韓州，大業初，州廢。長平郡，舊曰建州，開皇初，改澤州。菩，蒲乎翻。薩，桑葛翻。耼，他甘翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋志：临汾郡，晋州。绛郡，后魏置东雍州，后周改绛州。上党郡，后周置潞州。上党郡襄垣县，后周置韩州，大业初，州废。长平郡，旧曰建州，开皇初，改泽州。菩，蒲乎翻。萨，桑葛翻。耼，他甘翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":232,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6c-db0e-11ef-9231-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻。帥，讀曰率；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻。帅，读曰率；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":273,"tongjian_id":"b4548b80-db0e-11ef-a30a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"司法，卽法曹行參軍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"司法，即法曹行参军。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":327,"tongjian_id":"b4548b81-db0e-11ef-9441-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"mì","source_anchor_text":"數百騎戴羃䍦詐稱諒","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":29,"text":"羃","tongjian_id":"dfa41975-2008-5c56-b640-dbf45d33cbd0"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"lí","source_anchor_text":"百騎戴羃䍦詐稱諒宮","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":30,"text":"䍦","tongjian_id":"45407678-b4fe-50ee-9ffb-d179a7851fd9"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b4569a7d-db0e-11ef-8b20-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b4569a81-db0e-11ef-9cd4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"山西省永济市","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"b4569a86-db0e-11ef-bf9f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"b4569a8e-db0e-11ef-85ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":183,"tongjian_id":"b4569a9a-db0e-11ef-aba1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷三十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业十三年，李渊引兵自河东济河而西，朝邑法曹靳孝谟以蒲津...","context_before":"...皇中，诸州调物，每岁河南自潼关，河北自蒲坂，输于长安]。","source_end_index":1059,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c54d552-e93f-572b-bfac-fd23d44666a3","source_start_index":957,"source_text":"仁寿末，汉王谅谋举兵并州，裴文安说谅曰：今率精锐，直入蒲津，以大军继后，风行电击，顿于霸上[见陕西长安县]，咸阳以东，指挥可定，京师震扰，谁敢不从。谅不能用，而遣将断河桥，守蒲州，杨素衔枚潜济，谅军遂败。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷三十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业十三年，李渊以晋阳举义，兵遂下汾、晋，取关中。唐武德...","context_before":"...指太原，倾其巢穴，便可一举而定。周主用其策，而高齐果覆。","source_end_index":507,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"192e46c4-d698-5aa2-af71-576441d161eb","source_start_index":397,"source_text":"隋仁寿末，汉王谅起兵晋阳，遣其党余公理出大谷、趣河阳[见河南重险]，綦良出滏口。[见河南磁州]，趣黎阳[见直隶濬县]，刘建出井陉[见直隶重险]、略燕赵，乔钟葵出雁门、略代北，又遣裴文安等入蒲津，径指长安，寻为杨素所破败。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"帝以右武衞將軍洛陽丘和爲蒲州刺史，鎭蒲津。諒選精銳數百騎戴羃䍦，詐稱諒宮人還長安，門司弗覺，徑入蒲州，城中豪傑亦有應之者；丘和覺其變，踰城，逃歸長安。蒲州長史勃海高義明、司馬北平榮毗皆爲反者所執。裴文安等未至蒲津百餘里，諒忽改圖，令紇單貴斷河橋，守蒲州，而召文安還。文安至，謂諒曰：「兵機詭速，本欲出其不意。王旣不行，文安又返，使彼計成，大事去矣。」諒不對。以王耼爲蒲州刺史，裴文安爲晉州刺史，薛粹爲絳州刺史，梁菩薩爲潞州刺史，韋道正爲韓州刺史，張伯英爲澤州刺史。代州總管天水李景發兵拒諒，諒遣其將劉暠襲景；景擊斬之。諒復遣喬鍾葵帥勁勇三萬攻之，景戰士不過數千，加以城池不固，爲鍾葵所攻，崩毀相繼，景且戰且築，士卒皆殊死鬬；鍾葵屢敗。司馬馮孝慈、司法呂玉並驍勇善戰，儀同三司侯莫陳乂多謀畫，工拒守之術，景知三人可用，推誠任之，己無所關預，唯在閤持重，時撫循而已。","content_fanyi":"隋炀帝任命右武卫将军、洛阳人丘和为蒲州刺史，镇守蒲津。杨谅挑选数百名精锐骑兵，戴着妇女遮面的羃䍦，诈称是杨谅的宫人要返回长安，守门卫士没有察觉，径直进入蒲州，城中也有豪侠亡命之徒响应；丘和发觉情况异常，翻越城墙逃回长安。蒲州长史勃海人高义明、司马北平人荣毗都被反叛者抓获。裴文安等人距离蒲津关还有一百多里时，杨谅忽然改变计划，命令纥单贵拆断河桥，据守蒲州，并召回裴文安。裴文安回来后，对杨谅说：“用兵的关键在于诡诈而神速，原本是想趁对方不备。大王既然没有亲自前行，文安又被召回，让对方的计谋得以成功，大事就无法挽回了。”杨谅没有回答。杨谅任命王聃为蒲州刺史，裴文安为晋州刺史，薛粹为绛州刺史，梁菩萨为潞州刺史，韦道正为韩州刺史，张伯英为泽州刺史。代州总管天水人李景发兵抵抗杨谅，杨谅派部将刘暠袭击李景；李景迎击并斩杀刘暠。杨谅又派乔钟葵率领三万精兵进攻李景，李景手下战士不过数千人，加上城池并不坚固，遭到乔钟葵进攻后城墙接连崩毁，李景一边作战一边修筑，士兵都拼死搏斗；乔钟葵屡次被击退。代州司马冯孝慈、司法吕玉都骁勇善战，仪同三司侯莫陈乂足智多谋，擅长防御固守之术，李景知道这三人可以重用，便诚心任用他们，自己不加以干预，只在衙署内坐镇主持大计，时常抚慰巡视而已。","content_jianti_auto":"帝以右武衞将军洛阳丘和为蒲州刺史，镇蒲津。谅选精锐数百骑戴羃䍠，诈称谅宫人还长安，门司弗觉，径入蒲州，城中豪杰亦有应之者；丘和觉其变，逾城，逃归长安。蒲州长史勃海高义明、司马北平荣毗皆为反者所执。裴文安等未至蒲津百余里，谅忽改图，令纥单贵断河桥，守蒲州，而召文安还。文安至，谓谅曰：「兵机诡速，本欲出其不意。王既不行，文安又返，使彼计成，大事去矣。」谅不对。以王耼为蒲州刺史，裴文安为晋州刺史，薛粹为绛州刺史，梁菩萨为潞州刺史，韦道正为韩州刺史，张伯英为泽州刺史。代州总管天水李景发兵拒谅，谅遣其将刘暠袭景；景击斩之。谅复遣乔钟葵帅劲勇三万攻之，景战士不过数千，加以城池不固，为钟葵所攻，崩毁相继，景且战且筑，士卒皆殊死鬬；钟葵屡败。司马冯孝慈、司法吕玉并骁勇善战，仪同三司侯莫陈乂多谋画，工拒守之术，景知三人可用，推诚任之，己无所关预，唯在合持重，时抚循而已。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17435,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十 (隋紀四) / 高祖文皇帝下 / 仁壽四年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f","year_int":604},"tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"蒲州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","resolved_place_entity_id":933,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b4569abb-db0e-11ef-a89c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"楊素將輕騎五千襲王耼、紇單貴於蒲州，夜，至河際，收商賈船，得數百艘，船內多置草，踐之無聲，遂銜枚而濟；遲明，擊之；紇單貴敗走，耼懼，以城降。有詔徵素還。初，素將行，計日破賊，皆如所量，於是以素爲幷州道行軍總管、河北道安撫大使，帥衆數萬以討諒。","content_fanyi":"杨素率领五千轻骑兵到蒲州袭击王聃、纥单贵，夜里抵达黄河岸边，征集商人船只，得到数百艘，在船内铺满草，人马踩上去没有声响，又让士兵口衔枚、马匹口含木片，静悄悄地渡过黄河；天刚亮时发起攻击；纥单贵战败逃走，王聃恐惧，献城投降。隋炀帝下诏召回杨素。起初，杨素将要出发时，曾预先估算击破叛军的日期，结果完全与他的预料一致，朝廷于是任命杨素为并州道行军总管、河北道安抚大使，率领数万军队讨伐杨谅。","content_jianti_auto":"杨素将轻骑五千袭王耼、纥单贵于蒲州，夜，至河际，收商贾船，得数百艘，船内多置草，践之无声，遂衔枚而济；迟明，击之；纥单贵败走，耼惧，以城降。有诏征素还。初，素将行，计日破贼，皆如所量，于是以素为幷州道行军总管、河北道安抚大使，帅众数万以讨谅。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17436,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十 (隋紀四) / 高祖文皇帝下 / 仁壽四年 / 第 16 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b4569ab2-db0e-11ef-a3f7-a0d3651f611f","year_int":604},"tongjian_id":"b4569ab2-db0e-11ef-a3f7-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":4,"total_paragraphs":31},"place_name":"蒲州"},"message":"success","success":true}